<p>Jordan is fine. Jordan is attractive and interested and available and none of those things are wrong and I still can't bring myself to type back. Not tonight. Tonight the thought of someone new in my life, someone who only knows Mia, someone who would have to learn me from scratch because the person I used to be is not a person they'll ever meet, is exhausting.</p>

