:: D05_Phone_DatingApp [nobr]
<<HUD>>

<<ImagePlaceholder "Dating profile setup, mirror selfie" "portrait" "assets/ui/phone/dating-app-profile.png">>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>The profile setup takes ten minutes. One photo. The bathroom selfie with the good angle, the one where the light from the window catches my cheekbones and my eyes look green instead of hazel. I look at it for a long time before I upload it.</p>

<p>This is Mia. This is what Mia looks like to strangers on the internet.</p>

<p>She looks good. That's not vanity. That's data. The bones NovaCure built from Marcus's raw material are symmetrical and sharp and assembled in a combination that the algorithm is going to love.</p>

<p>Bio. Four words.</p>

<p><strong>Mia, 20, figuring things out.</strong></p>

<p>Submit.</p>

<p>I make tea. Earl Grey, which Marcus hated and Mia is discovering she likes. The kettle boils. The tea steeps. I add honey because there's no sugar.</p>

<p>Eleven minutes later I pick up the phone.</p>

</div>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>Forty-seven likes. Twelve matches. Six messages.</p>

<p>I scroll through the messages. Each one is a man who saw my photo and decided I was worth three to seven words of his time.</p>

</div>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>"hey beautiful." Low effort. Casting a wide net.</p>

<p>"you're gorgeous." See above but with better vocabulary.</p>

<p>"you seem cool, want to grab coffee?" Reasonable. Normal. The kind of message a human sends.</p>

<p>"sit on my face." And there it is. Six minutes into having a dating profile and someone has already suggested I use their face as furniture.</p>

<p>"hi! love your vibe." What vibe. My bio is four words long. What vibe is he detecting.</p>

<p>"dtf?" Three letters. No greeting. No punctuation. The absolute minimum viable product of human communication.</p>

</div>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>So this is dating for women. The volume is insane. Marcus went weeks without a match. Mia has been live for eleven minutes and six men have entered the chat, two of them with their dicks as their primary credential.</p>

<p>I close the app. The notification badge will keep climbing. By morning it'll be triple digits. The algorithm feeds fresh faces to hungry eyes and my face is very, very fresh.</p>

</div>

<<set $datingAppCreated to true>>
<<set $phone.datingActive to true>>

<div class="choice-block">
	<<link '<span>☕ Reply to the coffee message</span>' "D05_Phone_DatingApp_Chris">><</link>>
	<<link '<span>✋ Read and close</span>' "D05_Phone_DatingApp_Close">><</link>>
</div>


